  "notes": [
    "Census from tools/dungeongen/testdata/map35 (137 spawns) and ~/tortoise-wow/sql/base: trash 61 elite, faction 16, 11-18k hp; bosses 62.",
    "Six bosses: Volkan, Damian, Aszosh, Black Bride, Tham'Grarr, Arc'tiras. The instance script (src/scripts/dungeons/stormwind_vaults/instance_stormwind_vaults.cpp) opens the Vault Door 4000509 when the four bosses Black Bride/Tham'Grarr/Aszosh/Damian are dead (its OnCreatureDeath sets all four flags on the first of them) and Arc'tiras closes it on aggro; Arc'tiras is the optional last boss (its death also removes the ice-block obstruction 5001265/5001289 and spawns loot GO 2010867 at -46.26 179.48).",
    "The rat trap GO 3000273 at -1.697 116.335 -40.0507 (stormwind_vault_rat_trap AI) teleports a player within 5 yd to itself, closes the two Portcullis Small doors 3000275/3000276 (state 0 = open) and summons 15 Vault Rats 93106 (entry not spawned otherwise) that attack; the doors reopen when no rat is within 5 yd. No plan point lies within 5 yd of it, but the corridor is the lower floor's east-west link: never route a move through x -6.8..4.1 at y 116 on z -40.",
    "No creature_groups and no creature_linking row for any map-35 spawn: no boss guard is linked; the guards inside a boss's detection are folded into boss.first instead.",
    "No EventAI flee and no healer among the trash: fleers, cc_priority and cc_always stay empty (the only humanoid is 60597, whose spells are physical; no Polymorph target worth it).",
    "Casters (creature_spells): 60596 Arcane Bolt/Arcane Explosion, 60598 Black Sludge/Corrosive Acid Spit, 60599 Frailty/Strike, 60601 Frostbolt/Frost Nova, 60602 Scorch/Blast Wave, 60603 Arcane Missiles/Drain Mana, 60604 Enveloping Web/Infected Wound, 93105 Venom Spit. All cast with CF_FORCE_CAST (through walls); the grellkin also with CF_MAIN_RANGED_SPELL (they do not chase until the cast fails).",
    "Boss scripts: Volkan blinks behind a random player every 30 s (threat reset), Bloodlust at 70/40/10 %, Thunderclap, Bladestorm at 5 % until death. Black Bride: Lich Slap, Screams of the Past, Shadow Bolt Volley; its template also carries Possess 17244 and Silence 18327. Damian: Vanish at 70/40/10 %, Dark Mending (heal) and The Ripper's Madness (kills his victim), Backstab/Gouge/Sinister Strike. Aszosh: Summon Risen Lackey 10482, Drain Life at 80/40/20 %, Mind Blast every 5 % of his health, Corruption. Tham'Grarr: Rain of Fire, Fireball on a random player, Knock Away, Ice Block at 10 %. Arc'tiras: rooted, Frostbolt 3.5 s, Cause Insanity on a random non-tank, two Frigid Guardians 60612 at 60 %, Frost Nova every 6.5 s at 35 %.",
    "Adds no spawn row can name: Risen Lackey 10482 (Aszosh), Frigid Guardian 60612 (Arc'tiras), Vault Rat 93106 (rat trap), Black Bride's Possess.",
    "Mapping walk: the plan's 22 run-leader hop notices (a pull or boss 50-104 yd from the move row before it) and the floor seams the draft's detours pointed at (a 12-yd drop at -10.18 101.12 -39.05 from the upper hall to the lower), plus the rat-trap corridor at x -6.8..4.1, y 116, z -40. The census rebuilt every pull from the spawn rows (no position invented) and set every radius to farthest+0.5 (4.9-8.3 yd) so no pull reaches its neighbour."
  ],
